{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝起きたら、体が90度曲がって抱き枕が遠いところに飛んでいってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね。\n抱き枕。可愛い抱き枕です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな抱き枕かというと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご想像にお任せします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝違えて体も痛い〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月にはみかんですね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN24WVMJ1CR4C7FEX5F6SVQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛もみかんヘアー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みかんは大好きなので、1日5個とか食べてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、1粒の大きさが丁度いいので愛犬についついあげてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビタミン Cだからいいのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねだってくる愛犬も可愛くてさらにあげてしまいたくなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN24YP1EA8VQF716G6T1CHY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nマロン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ヘルニアになってしまうので、心を鬼ににして1粒までにしなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふーちゃん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN24ZSEW4BRJKQ5Y16CHPJ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どや顔(  ¯﹀¯  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴーす。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2525XEF1H6S9N7R1WWAKT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さんかく〜⊿△▽▼▲"}],"source":"archive"}